      "releaseNotes": "We're always working to make StoryReel better, bringing you a smoother, faster, and more enjoyable short drama experience.\n\nWhat's new in this version:\n • More captivating short dramas have been added, with fresh stories arriving regularly.\n • Performance improvements and bug fixes for a smoother viewing experience.\n\nUpdate to the latest version and start your next binge today.\nThanks for being part of the StoryReel community!",
